> **Stay with it longer, break it down, learn from mistakes, and try again.**

### 🤖 AI/ML
When concepts become complex:

> **Don't escape immediately. Learn step by step and build understanding.**

### 🎤 Placements
When rejection or failure happens:

> **Review → Learn → Improve → Try again.**

